  <item>
    <title>E01. 接纳自我是一生的修行（妇女节快乐）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65eb2d302d96b6aa809c7598</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65eb2d302d96b6aa809c7598</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Mar 2024 15:22:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 播客的起源：祝我们生日快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">4:17</a> 接纳自己是一生的修行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">9:24</a> 自我怀疑是一种想要突破上限的冲动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 女性的自我怀疑常态：感情中不被坚定选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 走出自我怀疑是一种转念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 走出怀疑的方法1：先动起来，找回能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 走出怀疑的方法2：观察自己获得快乐的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 身体健康是心灵健康的基础</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 允许自己有波动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 自我接纳是流动的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 自我接纳是不断的认识自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 顺其自然的走进自己的叙事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 社会面具和内在状态的冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 生活是内在状态的"结果"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 女性要勇敢的自私一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 在关系中如何平衡自我和他者的边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 真的爱你的人一定希望你做自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 真正的爱是允许对方的奇怪，给予自由的空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1966">32:46</a> 所有的关系都是与自己的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 自我接纳的过程是一条英雄之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 生生不息是"野火烧不尽"</span></p>]]></description>
